# PaiBand Studio Theme Rules

This repository is a custom WordPress theme.

## Product/design direction

- PaiBand Studio is the primary website identity.
- TGS has a dedicated page but must not dominate the studio homepage.
- Preserve the v3.x dark/editorial direction.
- Primary accent is warm orange/gold.
- Light paper sections require dark text.
- Text over game key art requires strong dark overlay + light text.
- Do not reintroduce the removed "We want a game to be understandable in one sentence" homepage section unless explicitly requested.

## Facts

Do not invent or silently change factual information.

Current baseline:
- Restore Your Island release: 9 April 2026.
- Escape By Spoon release year: 2027.
- TGS booth: SELECTED INDIE 80 area · Booth E-26.
- Team data is defined in `page-team.php`.
- Current Team roster has 9 members, including Saeed Abbasi as Senior Programmer.
- Preserve the explicit Team array order unless the user asks to reorder it.

